    "b0001-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "f6639045a768900e65d236888c7fe0824e17578daaf1bf9d4122913663d4f15f",
      "targetHash": "76f990427f1286a5c33583afb5e7207deea2ddd6ab95a6924414488d2913c920",
      "machineHash": "76f990427f1286a5c33583afb5e7207deea2ddd6ab95a6924414488d2913c920",
      "machineText": "Wake 需通过 `WAILS_USE_WAKE=true` 主动启用，*并非*默认运行器。\\\n未设置该变量时，`wails3 build / package / sign / task` 的行为与以前完全相同。\\\n功能覆盖范围和行为可能会随版本而变化。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Wake is opt-in behind `WAILS_USE_WAKE=true` and is *not* the default runner.\\ With the variable unse…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:49Z"
    },
    "b0002-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "92aa16c3d3e739f8d2c98a059ebbcf64b1bb33f1c1fc825b1681b41a85b18915",
      "targetHash": "b82abb0e7dd50a4038a01f3f31fd8ed3f04d386c5e9dc531691721c94e10221c",
      "machineHash": "b82abb0e7dd50a4038a01f3f31fd8ed3f04d386c5e9dc531691721c94e10221c",
      "machineText": "Wake 是用于 `wails3` 的*实验性替代构建运行器*。它读取项目中已有的\\\n同一个 `Taskfile.yml`，支持相同的 task、dep、var、\\\ntemplate、include 和平台命名空间语法，并通过一个\\\n了解 Wails 的执行器运行它，而不是使用通用的 [Task](https://taskfile.dev)\\\n运行时。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Wake is an *experimental alternative build runner* for `wails3`. It reads the\\ same `Taskfile.yml` y…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:49Z"
    },
    "b0003-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "5fb619f4a77d8c7d16538de1d913cc6411995c0b19aa57eaa6447fd73c58e1ce",
      "targetHash": "703efe7dffee4d32432d6d5858c8ea1259fef465a5b7cfab66fc1dc82c052c59",
      "machineHash": "703efe7dffee4d32432d6d5858c8ea1259fef465a5b7cfab66fc1dc82c052c59",
      "machineText": "目标不是取代 Task，而是提供一个专为\\\nWails 项目的实际构建方式而设计的运行器，其语义、输出和默认设置\\\n与 `wails3` CLI 的其余部分保持一致。*如果你始终只使用 Wake，\\\n则无需更改 Taskfile。*",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "The goal isn't to replace Task. It's to provide a runner that's purpose-built\\ for the way Wails pro…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:49Z"
    },
    "b0004-heading-01": {
      "sourceHash": "77890c5d4168a3af5e9a2611921690bb9f2f6c2a02e7269ab9b268f2f1bbed00",
      "targetHash": "447ae0e5a317ac0632be54812aea7800dc44a907f57a5cdd288f61adddbae443",
      "machineHash": "447ae0e5a317ac0632be54812aea7800dc44a907f57a5cdd288f61adddbae443",
      "machineText": "存在的原因",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Why it exists",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
