    "b0005-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "a5e44c16555d94d0a59aaf619cb56a53b29b52de9cc126ab3d8e4cc36ac75fe0",
      "targetHash": "d8f086da7f92712f0ed620414b61fe8835515e61a59e1a24a15653b7e2c4c682",
      "machineHash": "d8f086da7f92712f0ed620414b61fe8835515e61a59e1a24a15653b7e2c4c682",
      "machineText": "Wake 和 Task 运行时都已编译到 `wails3` 中，两者都不需要\\\n单独安装二进制文件。区别在于 Wake *理解该领域*。\\\n通用运行器只会按照指定顺序执行 Taskfile 中列出的步骤。\\\nWake 知道 Wails 构建的实际_构成_：前端产物包\\\n会嵌入二进制文件，二进制文件会打包成平台特定的\\\n制品，同时还会生成图标和绑定；Wake 会利用这些知识\\\n以通用运行器无法做到的方式优化构建。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Both Wake and the Task runtime are compiled into `wails3` — neither needs a\\ separate binary install…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:49Z"
    },
    "b0006-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "0ea79729e67254a8d2a6d1c76c0537d09cb360e14d7fb807e24d700bb8f152c7",
      "targetHash": "d8d20048107b45c5cde1747955ed8b623fffc5d7811912a32e6a5e6a5ba825f6",
      "machineHash": "d8d20048107b45c5cde1747955ed8b623fffc5d7811912a32e6a5e6a5ba825f6",
      "machineText": "*它只执行构建实际需要的工作。* Wake 会自行跟踪每个步骤的实际输入和输出。对于 Go 构建，输入包括模块图以及依赖步骤的输出，因此当相关内容均未更改时，它会完全跳过编译器和链接器，而不是重新运行它们。只有当 Taskfile 预先明确列出要监视的具体文件时，通用运行器才能跳过某个步骤；Wake 则会根据自己已有的构建信息推导出来。对于无操作的重新构建，耗时大约为 *~20 ms（Wake），而 Task 约为 ~316 ms*。冷构建的实际耗时相同，因为主要时间都花在 `npm install`、Vite 和 Go 编译器上。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "*It only does the work a build actually needs.* Wake tracks the real inputs and outputs of each step…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:49Z"
    },
    "b0007-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "817ca342bd4e6730332d8833dfcbd4adebee233ed8a5e61b728b507e59d58777",
      "targetHash": "7b42daa75173b7d57a942c861a6b427445bd3da408aaca8f80fcaa6e2d2d0ab3",
      "machineHash": "7b42daa75173b7d57a942c861a6b427445bd3da408aaca8f80fcaa6e2d2d0ab3",
      "machineText": "*它知道哪些步骤可以同时运行。* Wake 了解哪些步骤相互独立，因此默认并行运行这些步骤，并在结果行中报告由此获得的加速幅度。如果同级步骤交错的输出会干扰问题调查，可使用 `WAKE_SERIAL=true` 退出并行执行。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "*It knows what can run at the same time.* Because Wake understands which steps are independent, it r…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:49Z"
    },
    "b0008-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "b5471fc3e67733d5913eaf377e8cc3f2595d5f242c19d6b0726d42c8af54c68b",
      "targetHash": "ad32d90a80f5bd6b0653843fd0b64dddf0806a8414ebd78dd48c01a4dd55413b",
      "machineHash": "ad32d90a80f5bd6b0653843fd0b64dddf0806a8414ebd78dd48c01a4dd55413b",
      "machineText": "*由 wails3 控制的结构化输出。* Wake 通过 wails3 自带的报告器呈现输出：每个计划步骤占一行、实时显示状态、结束时按颜色分类列出各阶段耗时，并在故障面板中提供可点击的 `file:line` 链接。`NO_COLOR` 和非 TTY 环境（CI 日志）会妥善降级。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "*Structured output controlled by wails3.* Wake renders through wails3's own reporter: one row per pl…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:49Z"
    },
    "b0009-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "d4d84a355adfeab9f25fc5cbfa7f51b167e9dca6032713d069f5be6a62d60bc1",
      "targetHash": "048eb564a634f3b239791337d6890dbdc1f69da7a4ac4b2414863f4ee758d7fb",
      "machineHash": "048eb564a634f3b239791337d6890dbdc1f69da7a4ac4b2414863f4ee758d7fb",
      "machineText": "*内置其中，因此可以随 Wails 一同发展。* Wake 是 `wails3` 的一部分，而不是第三方工具，因此可以直接在其上叠加新的构建能力，无需等待另一个项目实现这些功能。这也为原生运行跨平台脚本和工具创造了条件；目前，Taskfile 会调用 `wails3` 二进制文件来运行它们（每次调用都会生成一个进程）。将这项工作移至进程内可减少开销，也意味着未来还会有更多提速空间。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "*Built in, so it can grow with Wails.* Because Wake is part of `wails3` rather than a third-party to…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:49Z"
    },
