      "machineHash": "51b0eaa23dc26f3a8435937abb4171371044a19e4d66b3c3fc6afab5f431a438",
      "machineText": "具有*相同名称*的任务会覆盖基础任务。当覆盖定义提供列表字段（`cmds`、`deps`、`sources`、`generates`、`platforms`、`status`、`preconditions`、`aliases`）时，这些字段会*替换*基础定义中的对应字段；覆盖定义中省略的字段则保留基础定义中的值。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "A task with the *same name* overrides the base task. List fields (`cmds`, `deps`, `sources`, `genera…",
